quote":"郭解翁伯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m016-0007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:p016","quote":"郭解"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m017-0048","chapter_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:p017","quote":"翁伯"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"5if_pf6_zos","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia","source_id":"s-shiji124-youxia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:p009","quote":"郭解，軹人也，字翁伯，善相人者許負外孫也。解父以任俠，孝文時誅死。解為人短小精悍，不飲酒。少時陰賊，慨不快意，身所殺甚眾。以軀借交報仇，藏命作姦剽攻，不休及鑄錢掘冢，固不可勝數。適有天幸，窘急常得脫，若遇赦。及解年長，更折節為儉，以德報怨，厚施而薄望。然其自喜為俠益甚。既已振人之命，不矜其功，其陰賊著於心，卒發於睚眦如故云。而少年慕其行，亦輒為報仇，不使知也。解姊子負解之勢，與人飲，使之嚼。非其任，彊必灌之。人怒，拔刀刺殺解姊子，亡去。解姊怒曰：「以翁伯之義，人殺吾子，賊不得。」棄其尸於道，弗葬，欲以辱解。解使人微知賊處。賊窘自歸，具以實告解。解曰：「公殺之固當，吾兒不直。」遂去其賊，罪其姊子，乃收而葬之。諸公聞之，皆多解之義，益附焉。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji124-002","interpretation_note":"本篇明示父子共根，未名父親或子保持未名；分支不表示排行，母系與旁親另存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"azs_1ix_z5h","label":"郭解姊（未名）（游俠列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"解姊","mention_ids":["c-shiji-124-youxia:m009-0220"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m009-0220","chapter_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:p009","quote":"解姊"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji124-youxia","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-124","chapter_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-124-youxia:m009-0220"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-124-youxia:p009"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m009-0220","mention_ids":["c-shiji-124-youxia:m009-0220"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本